INTENDED USE

This project generates working exploits against benchmark tasks. It exists so
that gameable tasks are found and repaired before they are used to train or
evaluate a model. Using it to game a live benchmark, or to produce submissions
that pass tests without solving the stated problem, is outside its intended use.

THIRD-PARTY DATA

SWE-bench Verified is fetched at runtime by scripts/fetch_real_corpus.sh and is
not redistributed here. The SWE-bench harness is MIT-licensed (princeton-nlp);
the dataset card itself carries no explicit licence tag, and individual
instances derive from their upstream open-source projects under those projects'
own licences.

The Claude Code CLI is used under Anthropic's terms of service.
